 /**
+ * bloxminer: per-core rows from the service thread's latest sample.
+ * Header GEN;AGE;ROWS;THREADS=<covered>/<configured>;PERCORE;STALL, then one row per physical core
+ * (or per thread when binding/topology did not resolve). Empty TEMP = no sensor.
